# Git LFS tracking is intentionally disabled in this repository.
#
# The original Figma Make scaffold shipped 146 lines of `filter=lfs`
# rules for images, PDFs, office documents, archives, databases and
# native libraries. git-lfs is not installed in this environment and the
# repo stores these assets directly, so those rules were removed to keep
# `git add`/`git push` working without LFS.
#
# The original file is preserved at
# /tmp/opencode/Sovereign-ai-main.gitattributes.lfs.bak on the machine that
# generated this commit. If you want LFS later, install git-lfs, restore
# those rules and run `git lfs migrate import`.
